<title>USA: Best Products reviews merger offer.</title>
<headline>Best Products reviews merger offer.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Best Products Co Inc said on Tuesday that it is studying an unsolicited merger offer from Ocean Reef Management Inc, a private investment company.</p>
<p>Ocean Reef said earlier today that it would acquire Best Products for $2 a share.</p>
<p>Best Products said in a statement: &quot;We will not take a position on the proposed merger until we complete our review.&quot;</p>
</text>
